OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Frather cloudy evening wit the odd spot
OL,7,Fof rain and some mist and fog patches
OL,8,Faround. However, clear spells will
OL,9,Fdevelop from the north overnight,
OL,10,Fallowing it to turn chilly. Winds will
OL,11,Fremain light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FMonday promises to be a fine
OL,14,Fday with early mist soon clearing to
OL,15,Fgive some sunny periods. Perhaps a
OL,16,Flittle more cloud developing later.
OL,17,FTemperatures nearer average, and
OL,18,Fbecoming breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
